running.
    - The TLS shell creates a self-signed cert at /workspace/token_shell.crt; copy that file to clients 
to trust the cert or use openssl -CAfile.
    - Alerting via Rocket.Chat requires creating an incoming webhook in Rocket.Chat and supplying it via 
the ROCKETCHAT_WEBHOOK environment variable to the alert agent.
    

